         q     at r_M    at 2 r_M    reading
          0.5     1.414     1.225    threshold-boundary response
          1.0     2.000     1.500    REGISTERED: the linear transfer of the disruption criterion's force-ratio scaling
          1.5     2.828     1.837    bound-phase-space counting (f_pair ~ v_b^3, v_b^2 ~ M_eff)
       the discriminator: dlog10(excess) between q = 1 and q = 1/2 at 2 r_M = 0.088 dex;
       between q = 3/2 and q = 1 at 2 r_M = 0.088 dex (the slope falsifier's bite).
